      <p>DineX Ecopack supports overseas B2B customers with more than 20 years of packaging experience, a self-owned 30,000 m² production base and automated capacity of up to 120,000 units per day. Its manufacturing capabilities cover paper cups, bowls, burger boxes, kraft lunch boxes, salad containers, noodle boxes, trays and multi-compartment meal packaging.</p>
