      <p>From a manufacturing capability perspective, full-batch traceability and incoming-material inspection support consistent order control. Documentation can include BRC, FSC, ISO 9001, LFGB and FDA-related materials where applicable to the project. Buyers should still confirm the specific documents required for their product, destination and food-contact application.</p>
