          <p class="text-sm md:text-base text-muted-foreground m-0">Allow controlled variation for local menu style, serving temperature, delivery time, portion size, local language, allergen requirements, waste-stream rules, climate, and customer-facing event presentation. For example, an outdoor catering operation in a hot climate may require stronger cold-drink condensation control, while a hospital site may need more detailed meal identification labels. Variation should be approved, coded, and forecasted rather than purchased informally.</p>
