          <p class="text-sm md:text-base text-muted-foreground m-0">Test with actual food and actual service conditions. Fill the pack at normal temperature, apply the approved lid and label, hold it for the expected time, stack it, transport it in the normal crate or bag, and inspect leakage, grease migration, deformation, temperature impact, closure security, and presentation. Test multiple menu types, particularly soups, sauces, fried foods, salads with dressing, and hot rice meals. Retain documented results and approved samples.</p>
