          <p class="text-sm md:text-base text-muted-foreground m-0">Keep high-volume, common, longer-lead-time, and custom-printed SKUs centrally, with local buffers for daily service. Hold site-specific and urgent-use items closer to the point of consumption. Calculate reorder points from average demand, lead time, safety stock, seasonal events, and known customer bookings. Track matched components such as bowls and lids together. Maintain a controlled contingency stock of approved plain packaging for disruption recovery.</p>
