          <p class="text-sm md:text-base text-muted-foreground m-0">In 2026, corporate catering packaging programs will increasingly combine sustainability, digital control, and operational resilience. Buyers are expected to use more QR-enabled traceability, digital artwork approvals, consumption forecasting, packaging-to-menu analytics, and supplier performance dashboards. Sustainability requirements will continue shifting from broad claims toward evidence-based decisions: material sourcing, food-contact safety, recyclability or compostability conditions, local collection infrastructure, and practical reduction of unnecessary material.</p>
