          <p class="text-sm md:text-base text-muted-foreground m-0">Policy changes will remain market-specific. A pack that is suitable for one region may need different documentation, labeling, or recovery guidance in another. Global buyers should avoid assuming that one environmental claim works everywhere. The stronger strategy is to define the intended use, local disposal route, regulatory needs, and brand objective for each market, then select a packaging structure supported by documentation and real-world performance testing.</p>
