      <p>Industry demand differs because each channel has distinct packaging priorities. Meal-delivery operators focus on leak prevention, temperature retention, stacking, and tamper-evident presentation. Coffee chains prioritize cup insulation, lid compatibility, sleeve fit, and color consistency. Retail food brands often require shelf appearance, barcode readability, clear labeling zones, and consistent carton dimensions for case packing.</p>

