      <p>The table shows why qualification should be application-led. Buyers should define the food type, maximum fill temperature, holding time, delivery route, filling weight, storage condition, and preferred disposal claim before asking a supplier for documentation. This produces a more useful test plan and reduces the chance of ordering packaging that looks correct but performs poorly in service.</p>
